      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-07-17T09:19:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok, and now I'm finished listening. It was good, of course. I was surprised to hear not one, but TWO of my letters this week! One was even one I had completely forgotten about.</p>\n<p>Incidentally, I would like to apologize for both of them. If that doesn't tell you which ones they were, then... Well, that's probably for the best, honestly.</p>\n<p>I had another one that I was really hoping would show up, but unfortunately did not. I suspect that when they said \"we have 4... No, 3 OblivAeon questions,\" mine was the fourth that just missed the cut. It's a shame, too; I really feel like I nailed the impersonation I was going for.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:32.082Z",
