      "created_at": "2019-07-17T14:40:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For those who missed it (and in response to Adam's comment about Roman concrete being a lost technology), the \"secret\" of how Roman concrete is so durable <a href=\"https://www.engineering.com/DesignerEdge/DesignerEdgeArticles/ArticleID/15190/The-Secret-Ingredient-in-Ancient-Roman-Concrete-is-Seawater.aspx\">was recently identified</a>. :-o They still don't have the exact recipe, but they understand how it works and feel they can replicate it for projects where it might be appropriate and useful. :-D&nbsp;</p>",
