      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ogseamus/{size}/4830_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-07-17T16:20:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was a little sad that they did not answer my questions about the Definitive Edition. But one question did somewhat get answered in that episode. The key question I wanted to know is if the First Appearance variants and scenarios be sold separately from the Definitive Edition. This is my favorite board game but I cannot afford (justify to my wife) to rebuy all the content just for those pieces.</p>",
